WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.750
The prerequisite medium bomb is planted beside the knocked-down Ryu.

2
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:01.100
Ryu performs the recorded Drive Reversal on wake-up.

3
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:01.550
Kimberly guards the Drive Reversal.

4
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:01.950
Standing medium punch punishes the guarded reversal.

5
00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:02.500
The existing bomb launches Ryu during the punish.

6
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:02.950
Sprint launcher extends the bomb juggle.

7
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:03.800
Jumping medium punch links into the airborne special.

8
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:04.800
Air OD Bushin uses the performed medium-plus-heavy kick pair.

9
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:05.000
Medium bomb plant spends one additional can.
